  "question": {
    "text": "<p>A ring-shaped tube contains two ideal gases with equal masses and relative molar masses <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>32</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>28</mn></math>. The gases are separated by one fixed partition and another movable stopper <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></math> which can move freely without friction inside the ring. What is the value of the angle <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi></math>&nbsp;(in degree) at equilibrium?</p>\r\r<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\qt0077_e370fb485f41.jpg\" style=\"width: 194px; height: 198px;\" /></p>\r"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "192",
  "solution": {
    "text": "Pressure on both sides will be equal.<br /><br />i.e.,&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math><br /><br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <math> <mrow> <mfrac> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>n</mtext> <mn>1</mn> </msub> <mtext>RT</mtext> </mrow> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>V</mtext> <mn>1</mn> </msub> </mrow> </mfrac> <mo>=</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>n</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msub> <mtext>RT</mtext> </mrow> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>V</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msub> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </math>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<math> <mrow> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>n</mtext> <mo>=</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mtext>m</mtext> </mrow> <mrow> <mtext>M</mtext> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> </math><br /><br />or&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <math> <mrow> <mfrac> <mrow> <mtext>m</mtext> </mrow> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>M</mtext> <mn>1</mn> </msub> <msub> <mtext>V</mtext> <mn>1</mn> </msub> </mrow> </mfrac> <mo>=</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mtext>m</mtext> </mrow> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>M</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msub> <msub> <mtext>V</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msub> </mrow> </mfrac> <mtext>&#160;or&#160;</mtext> <mfrac> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>V</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msub> </mrow> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>V</mtext> <mn>1</mn> </msub> </mrow> </mfrac> <mo>=</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>M</mtext> <mn>1</mn> </msub> </mrow> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>M</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msub> </mrow> </mfrac> <mo>=</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>3</mn> <mn>2</mn> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>2</mn> <mn>8</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> <mo>=</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>8</mn> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>7</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </math><br /><br /><math> <mro